      "category": "admission",
      "field": "transcript_submission",
      "value": "You must have one set of transcripts from every college and university from which you earned a bachelor’s degree or higher sent to ASU. Official transcripts must be sent directly to ASU Admission Services from the issuing institution's records office either by mail or through a secured electronic transcript service. If you attended ASU, you do not need to request ASU transcripts to be sent.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": null,
      "metadata": {
